[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 552.55, "timestamp": "00:09:12", "text": "我已經習慣這種情況很多年了。啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 557.67, "timestamp": "00:09:17", "text": "你好。歡迎光臨。歡迎，歡迎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 572.949, "timestamp": "00:09:32", "text": "問題是，當你因為 BBC 的那篇文章而在谷歌上搜尋我的時候，上面寫著我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 581.19, "timestamp": "00:09:41", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 586.15, "timestamp": "00:09:46", "text": "就像上面寫的那樣，稱呼我為他，所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 588.71, "timestamp": "00:09:48", "text": "還有，就像在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 595.59, "timestamp": "00:09:55", "text": "Vicki 的關鍵字裡一樣。等等，"}]